text = "• Keys 1–5 (or Dropdown): Switch showcase scenario
• Tab / V (or Button): Transfer to 2D View (Camera2D)
• Right-Click & Drag: Orbit 3D camera around selected body
• Mouse Wheel: Zoom 3D camera in and out
• Double-Click Planet / Moon / Probe: Lock perspective to that body
• Double-Click Central Star: Reset to root perspective
• R Key: Cycle Inertial / Surface-Locked / Synodic (L1–L5) frame
• H Key (or Hide/Instructions): Collapse or expand this panel"

